        "fa": "برچسب: در شیردهی با احتیاط؛ متن برچسب را ببینید.",
        "en": "Label: use with caution while breastfeeding; see the label text."
      },
      "quote": "Risk Summary Sildenafil is not indicated for use in females.",
      "refs": [
        {
          "source": "fda-sildenafil",
          "section": "8.2"
        }
      ]
    },
    "pediatric": {
      "level": "caution",
      "text": {
        "fa": "برچسب Revatio: برای PAH در کودکان ۱ تا ۱۷ سال تأیید شده؛ برای اختلال نعوظ در کودکان کاربرد ندارد.",
        "en": "Revatio label: approved for PAH in children 1–17 years; erectile-dysfunction use does not apply to children."
      },
      "quote": "The safety and efficacy of REVATIO have been established in pediatric patients 1 to 17 years old, for the treatment of PAH (WHO Group I) to improve exercise ability and, in patients too young to perform standard exercising testing, pulmonary hemodynamics thought to underlie improvements in exercise.",
      "refs": [
        {
          "source": "fda-revatio",
          "section": "8.4"
        }
      ]
    },
    "geriatric": {
      "level": "caution",
      "text": {
        "fa": "برچسب: در سالمندان با احتیاط و معمولاً از دوز پایین شروع شود.",
        "en": "Label: use with caution in older adults, usually starting at the low end of the dose range."
      },
      "quote": "Healthy elderly volunteers (65 years or over) had a reduced clearance of sildenafil resulting in approximately 84% and 107% higher plasma AUC values of sildenafil and its active N-desmethyl metabolite, respectively, compared to those seen in healthy young volunteers (18-45 years) [ see Clinical Pharmacology (12.3) ].",
      "refs": [
        {
          "source": "fda-sildenafil",
          "section": "8.5"
        }
      ]
